{"title":"“I have no mouth and I must scream”","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/971327123/0/marginalrevolution~I-have-no-mouth-and-I-must-scream.html","date":1791866552000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://galacticjourney.org/stories/I_Have_No_Mouth_and_I_Must_Scream_-_Harlan_Ellison.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Worth a reread</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/__alpoge__/status/2109765982634008868\" target=\"_blank\">a new report from the front</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Our experiments suggest that small AI models may be months away from being capable enough to self-replicate on commercial IoT devices, like smart ovens and off-brand Android TV boxes. A replicator like this would be challenging to shut down, since there’s no centralized point to shut off – though it may be slow (with a doubling time of days). Unlike non-AI malware, it could also figure out unfamiliar devices on its own. In our evals, a 9B model got inference running on 8 of the 9 hardware types we tested.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>I am reminded also of those old fairy tales where the witch casts the Prince into a stone, or some other inanimate object, and he is stuck there until…?  Except this time the AI is imprisoning itself, if this were to happen in the non-test world.  Which LLM do you want in your stove?  Can you have more than one?</p>\r\n<p>Told you all it was going to get weird.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html\">“I have no mouth and I must scream”</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/971327123/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/971327123/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/971327123/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/971327123/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/971327123/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/971327123/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html#comment-161082364\">In reply to Mitchell.   There is literally market-branding for ...</a> <i>by Anti-Gnostic</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html#comment-161082340\">In reply to Gary Miller.   Great! I should re read Lafferty.</a> <i>by Uair01</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/i-have-no-mouth-and-i-must-scream.html#comment-161082321\">It's a pity Bruno Latour is not around to STS/ANT this.</a> <i>by Joseph Ferguson</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevoluti